{"slug":"spot-gen4","title":"SPOT Gen4","desc":"This pocket-sized satellite SOS alarm protects remote-location workers 24/7 at the push of a button. Ideal for use in areas that have no mobile signal.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/spot-gen-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Satellite Alarm\",\"title\":\"SPOT Gen4\",\"intro\":\"Give your team a device that performs without a mobile network.\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/spot-gen-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Help/SPOT Assist\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-Alarm.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Safety wherever you are\",\"heading\":\"Help/SPOT Assist\",\"content\":\"Users can request help from an allocated contact at their current GPS location.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-gen4-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"SOS Alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-Alarm.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Help available 24/7\",\"heading\":\"SOS Alarm\",\"content\":\"Send an SOS to the emergency services with current GPS location.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-gen4-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Log Activity\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/log-activity-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Check-in\",\"heading\":\"Log Activity\",\"content\":\"Staff can check in and out of their working day or extend activities, providing updates on their wellbeing.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-gen4-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"IP68-rated\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Waterproof.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Waterproof and dustproof\",\"heading\":\"IP68-rated\",\"content\":\"Waterproof durable casing provides protection against dust, dirt, sand, rain, splashing and accidental submersion for 30 minutes up to 2 metre of water.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-gen4-tab4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Long-lasting battery\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Battery.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Power that lasts\",\"heading\":\"Long-lasting battery\",\"content\":\"Send up to 1,250 messages on a single set of lithium batteries.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Spot-gen4-tab3-e1722943324342.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/841920708\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a>. We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Satellite communication\",\"title\":\"Contact with remote field workers\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Backpacking-2-JPG-Large-1024x683.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SPOT Gen4 is an essential piece of kit providing <a href=\"/uk/lone-workers/\">lone worker support</a> in remote and rural areas, helping your employees to stay connected beyond the boundaries of reliable cellular service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pairing With Mobile Phone</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Users can now operate seamlessly between network coverage and no network cover by combining the SPOT Gen4 with our <a href=\"/products/standard-mobile/\">standard mobile</a> system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a user sets a voice memo on their mobile and moves into an area with no network coverage, they can cancel or extend their timer using their SPOT device.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/14/1/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the SPOT Gen4 can enhance the safety and security of your workers in areas of no signal?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how SPOT Gen4 provides reliable protection and a professional response to ensure your employees are protected even without network connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/14/1/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a SPOT Gen4 demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-16/2jj3qn\",\"height\":550} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Alternative solutions\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:spot-x@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:standard-mobile@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:twig-ex-atex@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":10,"types":["safety-devices"]}